/P 45 0 R
/E (I also implemented systems for training data collection and model integration using Unity ML-Agents, extending the framework to support custom model configurations and agent behaviours. Training input data and output artifacts were sorted, processed and stored using a python oriented CI/CD processes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
