/P 45 0 R
/E (In addition, I contributed to CI/CD pipelines used to build training environments, run automated training sessions, and generate model artifacts and analytics for integration into mobile application builds. Training sessions were run on containerized EC2 sessions, each session running multiple parallel training sesions. By injecting training parameters into the CI process, we were able to generate model varietals en-masse, with data analytics being used to automate model sucess / selection.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [19]
>>
